[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
MiroTalk SFU has been installed under %%WWWDIR%% using the HARDENED build.

Enable it in /etc/rc.conf or /etc/rc.conf.local:

    mirotalk_enable="YES"

Configure ordinary deployment and site settings in
%%PREFIX%%/etc/mirotalk/mirotalk.conf. Configure localized site text in
%%PREFIX%%/etc/mirotalk/site-translations.json, using its sample file.
Meeting names and restrictions: meeting-properties.json.
With the LDAP option, configure ldap/ldap.conf and ldap/group-meetings.json
before setting LDAP_ENABLED=true. Default groups and group grants belong in
ldap/group-meetings.json. The rc script reads or creates jwt-secret.

See mirotalk(8), mirotalk.conf(5), and mirotalk-ldap.conf(5).
Read %%DOCSDIR%%/HARDENING.md for behavior and limits.

To use the standard MiroTalk configuration and build instead, select the
STANDARD build option and rebuild/reinstall the port.
EOM
}
]
